From 4ed09c9f708f618928effd43c982058614130cf2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quintin Smits <qd.smits@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:42:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] perf(ui): memoise the Properties cutter outline

Properties computed cutter_profile::check and the outline on every
frame while a drawn cutter was landed. Key a memo on the draft tool
value and the cutter draft points (never doc_version), as the library
preview's model memo does, and name the work with frame_cost::span.

Fixes the review finding on PR #3914.

Refs #3894

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
